<title>NETHERLANDS: Touax buys Dutch barge operator Ducotra.</title>
<headline>Touax buys Dutch barge operator Ducotra.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Interfeeder Rotterdam BV, a unit of French transport group Touax S.A., said on Thursday it had taken over barge container transport firm Ducotra.</p>
<p>The takeover, of which no financial details were given, will double Touax's turnover in the Netherlands to about 25 million guilders ($12.6 million), the company said.</p>
<p>The new combination will be named Interfeeder Ducotra BV and will be active in the Middle and Upper Rhine areas. Touax will increase its market share in the next two years further by organic growth and takeovers, Interfeeder Rotterdam said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040 ($ = 1.985 Dutch Guilders)</p>
